      "voiceName": "Trevor Noah",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Men think \"I'm going to come\" is a promise. \nWomen think it's more of a\u2026 bus schedule. \n\nThe bus is coming. When exactly? That's between her and the universe. \n\nMy new special Joy in the Trenches is on Netflix now.\n\nVideo",
